[by:YJlife666]
[00:00.00]作词 : Bob Crewe/Bob Gaudio
[00:01.00]作曲 : Bob Crewe/Bob Gaudio
[00:15.48]You're just too good to be true
[00:15.48]你美得令人不敢置信
[00:19.45]Can't take my eyes off of you
[00:19.45]你的美让我目不转睛
[00:23.37]You feel like heaven to touch
[00:23.37]你的温柔如同天堂的触碰
[00:27.40]I wanna hold you so much
[00:27.40]我只想将你紧紧拥抱
[00:31.20]At long last love has arrived
[00:31.20]终于爱情降临在我身旁
[00:35.19]I thank god i'm alive
[00:35.19]感谢上天我仍在这世间
[00:39.22]You're just too good to be true
[00:39.22]你美得令人不敢置信
[00:42.99]Can't take my eyes off of you
